      "writtenOn": "2020-03-04T20:43:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see it defined only once, in an include arch/arm/boot/compressed/libfdt_env.h, a file that allows loading the device tree.\nRedefining it elsewhere in the kernel will probably not fly [stock, it has to look stock, remmeber :-)]\nWe are lucky uint32_t is defined...",
